          "id": "paragraph-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "加入解释：只比较相邻的两个值。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "semantic-scene": {
      "id": "semantic-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "semantic-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "value": 20
      }
    },
    "text-9": {
      "id": "text-9",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "动画的进度由原有播放器驱动。状态名称和 value 参数绑定到稳定步骤；刷新或任意跳步都应得到相同的目标画面。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "semantic-authoring-boundary",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这里可以直接切步观察状态与 value 参数，组件自己的公开按钮也能操作。当前文档尚无通用组件参数表单或共享素材版本管理界面；修改定义、参数约束或共享实例，应由工程编辑或助手事务修改同一份 lecture.json 并检查影响范围，不要在当前文档里寻找尚未提供的参数按钮。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "d3-scene": {
      "id": "d3-scene",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "d3-definition",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    "action-counter": {
      "id": "action-counter",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "counter-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "label": "已完成练习",
        "targetId": "component-action"
      }
    },
    "text-11": {
      "id": "text-11",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "点击“加一次”应确实增加计数。组件通过公开的 host 动作接口支持讲稿触发；这和只画一个按钮不同。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "guide-counter": {
      "id": "guide-counter",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "counter-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "label": "提示目标",
        "targetId": "feature-action"
      }
    },
    "guide-cursor": {
      "id": "guide-cursor",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "guide-cursor-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "path": [
          {
            "to": "#feature-action-add",
            "action": "move",
            "at": 0
          },
          {
            "to": "#feature-action-add",
            "action": "hover",
            "at": 1
          },
          {
            "to": "#feature-action-add",
            "action": "click",
            "at": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "guide-spot": {
      "id": "guide-spot",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "guide-spot-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "target": "#feature-action-add",
        "until": 3,
        "title": "实际按钮",
        "text": "聚光提示目标，仍可手动点击按钮。"
      }
    },
    "guide-hint": {
      "id": "guide-hint",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "guide-hint-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "target": "#feature-action-reset",
        "until": 3,
        "title": "重置",
        "text": "清零后可以重新练习。"
      }
    },
    "text-13": {
      "id": "text-13",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本讲使用 defineScene 和 D3。原有“代码写成的动画”分别展示 GSAP、Anime.js、Motion、Three.js 与 Remotion，七种实现共享步骤、时间和静态回退契约。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Three.js 需要可用的 WebGL；性能与画面依赖实际设备。关闭或离开场景时必须释放动画、订阅、定时器及图形资源。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
